{"id":"arconaut-bzn","title":"Reduce stream-capture write amplification with an explicit retention policy","description":"Current src/context.cpp AuditLog::original issues an identity and appends source plus log metadata per capture; src/coding.cpp connects provider response_observer to capture. Issuer ranges already reduce ID reservations, not these capture appends. Measure writes/syncs, CPU and response delivery latency under many small chunks. Choose useful capture content/lifetime and buffering or aggregation policy; raw transport bytes are not intrinsically required. Bound memory and flush latency; specify what is retained or discarded on cancellation/crash. Direct checks: small-chunk workload, partial response/cancel, completion visibility, write count and latency before/after. Do not reimplement completed ID batching.

Scope rule: no blanket requirement to preserve original bytes or historical wire representations. Retain only data justified by current session behavior, useful diagnostics, and preventing accidental replay of uncertain effects; state owners and lifetimes explicitly. Before implementation name concrete fixes and direct checks. Whole-unit allowance 90 minutes; hardening at most 25 minutes within it, initial fix plus one recheck only. Report measured remaining gaps; no full-suite certification or automatic extension.","notes":"First native CodingEngine delivery: bounded64KiB response diagnostic aggregation; completion/caught-error flush, immediate preview, crash may discard partial diagnostics, poisoned sink never replayed. Unit and actual engine100000 one-byte callbacks ->2 capture appends. Release blackbird built; stream_capture/coding_stream_capture pass on one recheck. Full coding test stops unsupported in retained_output_test, cause unlocated; not claimed green. Remains in progress for sync/CPU/latency measurements and completed-diagnostic retention lifetime; process/colleague captures unchanged. Report papers/2026-10-08-stream-capture-blocks.md.
Operator explicitly excludes further stream cost measurement. New diagnostics stored in removable private files with30day expiry, expired reads refused, bounded capture/reopen purge and --expire-diagnostics idle cleanup. Direct expiry/cleanup/coding checks pass. Legacy embedded streams remain finite older audit content. Sync/CPU/latency study and process/colleague capture expansion not undertaken; no active implementation owner.","status":"open","priority":1,"issue_type":"task","owner":"hiya@antimeme.ai","created_at":"2026-10-08T05:58:08Z","created_by":"blackbird","updated_at":"2026-10-08T09:19:06Z"}
